# Excludes third-party dependency source from CodeQL analysis for the
# interpreted languages (javascript-typescript, rust, actions).
# NOTE: neither this file nor codeql-config.yml's paths-ignore actually
# suppresses Java/Kotlin findings inside Capacitor plugins' bundled Java
# source under build-mode: manual -- GitHub's paths/paths-ignore filtering
# only applies to extraction for interpreted languages; a real Gradle
# build traces and indexes everything it compiles regardless, including
# third-party plugin modules the app depends on. Those findings must be
# dismissed by hand in the Code Scanning UI instead -- see
# docs/DECISIONS.md's C8b entry for the full reasoning. Kept here anyway
# since it's still real and effective for the interpreted-language jobs.
**/node_modules/**
**/target/**
**/dist/**
